Governance and Staking Began Driving Real Outcomes
Orderly introduced onchain governance in 2025, and it was used immediately to make real economic decisions.
The first proposal paused emissions, directed up to 60% of protocol revenue toward buying back $ORDER, and placed those tokens into a community-controlled vault.
Since governance went live, we purchased 3,282,105.20 $ORDER.
This directly connected platform usage, ownership, and decision-making into a single system.
We gave everyone access to strategies reserved for the privileged
