One Year of the $ORDER Token
2025 marked one year since the $ORDER token launched.
Over that year, its role became clearer.
Governance gained real authority.
Staking reflected platform usage.
Buybacks linked activity to value.
Treasury decisions became transparent.
97m $ORDER is currently staked. That's 60% of our circulating supply.
The token evolved from an incentive into a coordination tool for the ecosystem.
What 2025 Showed
2025 showed that onchain trading does not require every exchange to build everything from scratch.
Liquidity can be shared.
Risk can be managed centrally without giving up ownership.
Distribution can be open.
Governance can control real value.
This is how platforms grow.
